---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import personalImage from "../assets/images/me.webp";
---

<article
  class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 text-gray-300 md:flex-row"
>
  <div
    class="order-2 text-pretty [&>p]:mb-4 [&>p>strong]:text-primary md:order-1"
  >
    <p>
      Forward Deployed &amp; Applied AI Engineer working directly with stakeholders,
      from discovery and architecture to implementation and operations. AI agents
      accelerate delivery, backed by typed code, tests and CI/CD gates.
    </p>

    <p>
      EU citizen · GCP Associate Cloud Engineer · MBA in Software Engineering (USP)
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Applied AI:</strong> Claude API, Azure OpenAI, OpenAI SDK, MCP, tool calling,
      structured outputs, RAG, pgvector, Azure Speech STT/TTS and Video Indexer<br />
      <strong>Automation:</strong> n8n (Queue Mode), Puppeteer, pg-boss, Microsoft Graph and UiPath migration<br />
      <strong>Full-Stack:</strong> TypeScript (Node.js, Bun, Hono, NestJS), Rust (Axum, SQLx),
      SvelteKit, Vue/Nuxt, Astro, PostgreSQL, DuckDB<br />
      <strong>Cloud &amp; Infra:</strong> GCP (ACE), Oracle Cloud, Azure, Cloudflare, Railway,
      Docker, Linux VMs, Azure DevOps and GitHub Actions
    </p>
  </div>
  <Image
    src={personalImage}
    width={256}
    height={256}
    alt="Alexandre Spindola"
    class="order-1 aspect-square h-full w-64 rotate-3 rounded-2xl bg-yellow-500/5 p-1 object-cover ring-1 ring-white/20 md:order-2 lg:w-64 lg:p-2"
    style="object-position: 50% 50%"
  />
</article>
